---
/**
 * `/designs/rootweave-01` → `/designs/mens-cotton-shirt`.
 *
 * "RootWeave 01" is the product code printed on the featured concept's photography, so the
 * vanity URL is worth keeping — but the canonical page is the concept id. In Astro's static
 * build `Astro.redirect(..., 301)` emits a redirect page (a meta-refresh plus the status for
 * hosts that honour it); on Cloudflare Pages this resolves to the target.
 */
return Astro.redirect('/designs/mens-cotton-shirt', 301);
---
